Hurry up, we have an emergency at Central Hospital! Many patients are waiting for your help!

This is a happy hospital time management game, where you can play as a doctor, nurse, and help patients. You can also play the role of a hospital administrator, building, maintaining, and managing your hospital.

Here you can get money by helping patients and upgrade the various facilities of the hospital to create a perfect medical center.

Game Features:
- There are hundreds of different level objectives, the content of the level is exciting, and you will not get bored;
- Doctors from various departments will appear in the level, and you can help various patients;
- Perfect hospital facility upgrade system, no matter how difficult the level can be easily passed;
- Decorate your hospital, you can design different styles of equipment to create your own hospital;
- The unique achievement collection system makes your game no longer monotonous;
- Rich activity rewards bring a more fulfilling sense of purpose.

Want to build a world-class hospital? This is the best place for your dreams to come true!

Save The Dog is a casual puzzle game. You draw lines with your fingers to create walls that protect the dog from attacks by bees in the hive. You need to protect the dog with the painted wall for 10 seconds during the attack of the bees, hold on and you will win the game.

How to play:
1. Swipe the screen to create a wall to protect the dog;
2. As long as you don't let go, you can always draw the line;
3. You can let go after producing a satisfactory pattern;
4. Wait for the bees in the hive to attack;
5. Hold your wall for 10 seconds, so that the dog will not be attacked by bees;
6. You will win the game.

Game Features:
1. A variety of customs clearance methods;
2. Easy and funny customs clearance patterns;
3. Funny dog expressions;
4. Puzzle and interesting levels.

Welcome to try our game, if you have any comments on the game, you can give feedback in the game, thank you for your participation.
